{"unit_id":"tianji-qingtian__dsh-model-router#feature-1","repo":"tianji-qingtian/dsh-model-router","commit":"36fa5eb4225e4fe263d57f7ab7609edb8856f9d1","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-model-router 的功能「简单问题快速回答」：对用户问题做简单或复杂分类，并让用户选择是否由便宜模型直接回答。它在自动模式下触发，答案写入会话记录。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:284-319","src/index.js:481-549"]}
